 "_about": "Zoning parameters per town zone (L'Ametlla del Vallès PGO 1987, Text Refós 2005). Zone names come from the Mapa Urbanístic de Catalunya. Fill values from the normes urbanístiques; the map computes buildable m², dwellings and splits from them.",
